WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:05,720
Li Changsheng, you elder, get out of here.

2
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:30,160
How much does it cost

3
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,220
About ten thousand

4
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:38,480
Uncle, I won’t bear it anymore

5
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:41,050
From now on, I will eat meat every meal
